---
// src/components/StoreFrontFeature.astro
---

<section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-[#F6F3EE] border-t border-stone-200/70">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-14 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-6">
        <div class="rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-stone-200 relative aspect-[4/3]">
          <img
            src="/images/cotto/mekan-ic-salon.jpg"
            alt="Cotto Napoliten Mimari Konsept"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6 text-white">
            <span class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#E59838] block mb-1">ANAHTAR TESLİM MİMARİ</span>
            <p class="font-bold text-xl">İtalyan Bistro & Açık Özel Napoliten Fırın Sahnesi</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-5">
        <p class="text-[#D9381E] text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">
          MODERN İTALYAN BISTRO MİMARİSİ
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-[#141210] tracking-tight leading-tight uppercase">
          Misafirlerin Vakit Geçirmek İstediği <span class="italic font-serif text-[#D9381E] capitalize">Sıcak Atmosfer.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-stone-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
          Cotto Napoliten şubeleri, geleneksel Napoli özel Napoliten fırınlarının sıcaklığını modern bistro konforuyla birleştirir. Restoranın kalbinde yer alan özel Napoliten fırınımız, her misafir için görsel bir gastronomi şovuna dönüşür.
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 pt-4 border-t border-stone-200">
          <div>
            <div class="font-mono font-black text-2xl text-[#141210]">45 Günde</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-stone-500 font-medium">Anahtar Teslim Şube Kurulumu</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-mono font-black text-2xl text-[#D9381E]">3 Konsept</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-stone-500 font-medium">Express, Bistro ve Gastro Lounge</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
